# Jalankan: dotnet run --project src/Catsheet.Api   (lalu klik "Send Request" di IDE)
@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health (publik)
GET {{host}}/health

### 1) HTTP Basic
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Basic alice:alice123

### 2) JWT: ambil token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "alice123" }

### 2b) JWT: pakai token
GET {{host}}/api/me/jwt-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3) API key
GET {{host}}/api/me
X-Api-Key: dev-api-key-123

### 4) Cookie login (cookie disimpan otomatis oleh client .http)
POST {{host}}/auth/cookie/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "bob", "password": "bob123" }

### 4b) Pakai cookie
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Buat produk fisik (butuh catalog:write)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Basic alice:alice123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "Physical", "name": "Keyboard", "price": 750000, "currency": "IDR", "stock": 5, "weightKg": 1.2 }

### Buat produk digital pakai API key (role Service, tapi punya permission)
POST {{host}}/api/products
X-Api-Key: dev-api-key-123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "Digital", "name": "Kursus .NET", "price": 150000, "downloadUrl": "https://example.com/kursus" }

### Bob tidak boleh tulis catalog → 403
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Basic bob:bob123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "Digital", "name": "X", "price": 1000, "downloadUrl": "https://example.com/x" }

### List produk
GET {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Basic bob:bob123
